<title>INDIA: India's DCM Financial 96/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India's DCM Financial 96/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     78.1  vs   71.0</p>
<p>    Total income	  475.1  vs  364.4</p>
<p>    Div (percent)	  23.5  vs   25</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   104.5  vs   82.4</p>
<p>Interest and</p>
<p>     finance charges    181.5  vs  147.4</p>
<p>    Gross profit	  189.1  vs  134.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   91.3  vs   63.6</p>
<p>    Provision for tax    11.6  vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE: DCM Financial Services Ltd released the results in a statement. It had said in another statement earlier on Thursday that its 1996/97 earnings per share (EPS) of 6.03 rupees was higher than its projection of 5.97 rupees. It gave no comparative EPS figure for 1995/96.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
